# Atlas legend for the Centroid page sheet (cells.rgba).
# Written 2026-11-11. No legend file was in &.widgits/palettes before this.
# Pack legends: legend-rmmv.pdl, legend-mineclonia.pdl, legend-df.pdl, legend-cdda.pdl, legend-doom.pdl.
# The sheet is 384x72, 24px tiles, 16 columns, 43 tiles. Slot = row * 16 + column.
# Floor slot paints the top face. Rock slot paints the cliff sides.
# A name here is what the eye shows on that slot. A SOURCE row is where a replacement tile comes from.
#
# SLOT | n | name | use
SLOT | 0 | empty-black | unused
SLOT | 1 | grass | biome floor
SLOT | 2 | dirt-path | biome floor, roads, building pads
SLOT | 3 | water | biome floor
SLOT | 4 | sand | biome floor
SLOT | 5 | pale-sand | biome floor
SLOT | 6 | snow | high-band floor. Pixels are the RTP snow tile below, not the old pale cap.
SLOT | 12 | castle-roofs | roof cap only
SLOT | 13 | castle-wall | roof cap only
SLOT | 14 | castle-gate | roof cap only
SLOT | 15 | castle-corner | roof cap only
SLOT | 20 | town-houses | tree kit wall slot. The picture is a town, not a tree.
SLOT | 32 | dirt-object | object row. Not a biome.
SLOT | 33 | shop-sword | object row. Never a floor. Repeats a sword on every cell.
SLOT | 34 | wood-door | door module
SLOT | 35 | flat-orange | unused. Do not paint walls or floors with it.
SLOT | 36 | cliff-cobble | rock sides and building-frame walls
SLOT | 37 | planks | object
SLOT | 38 | blue-windows | window module
SLOT | 39 | wood-floor | object
SLOT | 40 | red-carpet | object
SLOT | 41 | white-plaster | wall module
SLOT | 42 | tan | object
#
# SOURCE | role | pack | file | x | y | w | h
# Outside_A2.png is 768x576. The crop is one 48px cell of the snow autotile, scaled to 24 for slot 6.
SOURCE | snow | rmmv | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/Outside_A2.png | 0 | 480 | 48 | 48
# Mineclonia snow is allowed as the same role. It is a 16px speckled cap, not the tile painted into slot 6.
SOURCE | snow-alt | mineclonia | #.NNEST_ASSETS/mineclonia/mods/ITEMS/mcl_core/textures/default_snow.png | 0 | 0 | 16 | 16
SOURCE | snow-side | mineclonia | #.NNEST_ASSETS/mineclonia/mods/ITEMS/mcl_core/textures/mcl_core_grass_side_snowed.png | 0 | 0 | 16 | 16
# World_A2.png bottom band is snow fields and snow mountains. It is the world-map sheet, not the page atlas.
SOURCE | snow-world | rmmv | #.NNEST_ASSETS/rmmv-www-img/tilesets/World_A2.png | 0 | 0 | 768 | 576
